ents win the first Diamond trick "],["pg",""],["ls","wd"],["pc","d"],["pc","d"],["pc","d"],["pg",""],["hs","wd"],["at","and play another Diamond "],["pg",""],["ls","wd"],["pc","dt"],["pc","d"],["pc","d"],["hs","sh"],["at","which you trump. "],["pg",""],["ls","sh"],["pc","h"],["pg",""],["hs","wh"],["hs","eh"],["at","Since you won't have too many losers if the trumps break, you can draw trump. "],["pg",""],["ls","wh"],["ls","eh"],["hc","ha"],["at","You play the @HA "],["pg",""],["lc","ha"],["pc","ha"],["pc","h"],["pc","h"],["pc","h"],["pg",""],["hc","hk"],["at","and @HK "],["pg",""],["lc","hk"],["pc","hk"],["pc","h"],["pc","h"],["pc","h"],["pg",""],["hs","wh"],["hs","eh"],["at","and fortunately, the trump divides nicely as both opponents follow suit. What now?"],["pg",""],["ls","wh"],["ls","eh"],["hs","sh"],["nt","\nLook what happens if you get carried away by getting the kiddies off the street. You play another trump "],["pg",""],["ls","sh"],["pc","h"],["hc","hq"],["at","and West wins the @HQ. "],["pg",""],["lc","hq"],["pc","hq"],["pc","h"],["pc","s"],["pg",""],["hs","wh"],["hs","eh"],["at","All the opponents' trump is gone, "],["pg",""],["ls","wh"],["ls","eh"],["hs","sh"],["at","but you have only one left. "],["pg",""],["ls","sh"],["hs","wd"],["at","West leads another Diamond "],["pg",""],["ls","wd"],["pc","d9"],["pc","d"],["pc","dk"],["hs","sh"],["at","and you will have to use your last trump to win the trick. "],["pg",""],["ls","sh"],["pc","h"],["pg",""],["hc","sa"],["nt","\nYou still have to drive out the opponents' @SA "],["pg",""],["lc","sa"],["hs","ns"],["at","to establish your Spade winners. "],["pg",""],["ls","ns"],["hc","sa"],["at","West wins the @SA, "],["pg",""],["lc","sa"],["pc","s"],["pc","sa"],["pc","s"],["pc","s"],["pg",""],["hs","wd"],["at","he leads more Diamonds and, "],["pg",""],["ls","wd"],["hs","sh"],["at","since you have no trump left, "],["pg",""],["ls","sh"],["hs","wd"],["hs","ed"],["at","the Diamonds are winners. You end up having to discard some of your winners on the Diamonds and you don't make your contract. You lost control of the hand!"],["pg",""],["ls","wd"],["ls","ed"],["up","12"],["hc","hak"],["nt","How could you prevent this loss from happening? It is a good idea to play the @HA and @HK "],["pg",""],["lc","hak"],["hs","wh"],["hs","eh"],["at","to draw some of the opponents trump. "],["pg",""],["ls","wh"],["ls","eh"],["hs","sh"],["at","At this point, you have two small trump cards left in your hand "],["pg",""],["ls","sh"],["hs","nh"],["at","and one small trump left in dummy. "],["pg",""],["ls","nh"],["hc","hq"],["at","The only oustanding trump is the @HQ, one of your losers. "],["pg",""],["lc","hq"],["hs","sh"],["hs","nh"],["at","You do not have to play two of your trump cards to draw out this one card. It is a trick that you have to lose, so let the opponents take it when they want. "],["pg",""],["ls","sh"],["ls","nh"],["hs","ss"],["nt","\nInstead, turn your attention to the work that has to be done and lead a Spade "],["pg",""],["ls","ss"],["pc","s"],["hc","sa"],["at","to drive out the opponents' @SA. West can win the @SA "],["pg",""],["lc","sa"],["pc","sa"],["pc","s"],["pc","s"],["pg",""],["hc","hq"],["at","and play the @HQ "],["pg",""],["lc","hq"],["pc","hq"],["hs","nh"],["hs","sh"],["at","to eliminate dummy's remaining trump and one of your trump cards.  "],["pg",""],["ls","sh"],["ls","nh"],["pc","h"],["pc","s"],["pc","h"],["pg",""],["hs","wd"],["at","Now when West leads another Diamond, "],["pg",""],["ls","wd"],["pc","d9"],["pc","d"],["pc","dk"],["hs","sh"],["at","you still have a trump left. You can win the trick "],["pg",""],["ls","sh"],["pc","h"],["pg",""],["at","and take all your remaining winners, making your contract."],["",""]]}}